      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "They are depended upon 4 components which are :\n\n1) entity - a object\n2) Controller - mapping the endpoints\n3) service - execute the business logic\n4) repository - communication with DB.\n\nNote :- DI is very imp here",
